*🔧 MCP Client Config (Claude / VS Code / Gemini CLI)*

Use Nancy Brain as an MCP tool in your editor. Full examples: <https://github.com/AmberLee2427/nancy-brain/blob/master/examples/mcp-settings.example.json|mcp-settings.example.json>

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "nancy-brain": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-sse",
        "--url", "https://your-server/sse",
        "--api-key", "$MCP_API_KEY"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
